      "statement": "The coordination protocol is specified in TLA+; the checker enumerates every reachable state at a small configuration, each configuration carries a pinned expected verdict (mostly failures modeling bugs the protocol once had), and the specifications are a hand-synced snapshot deliberately not in CI.",
